^O03Welcome to NCE.^O0f

  - To install or upgrade press the ^O07<ENTER>^O0f key.
  - To install or upgrade without a serial console, type ^O07no-serial <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To install or upgrade in safe mode, type ^O07safe <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To install or upgrade to a multipathed root disk, type ^O07multipath <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To install or upgrade using an alternate/debug kernel: ^O07install-alt <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To boot into a shell prompt, type ^O07shell <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To perform a memory test, type ^O07memtest <ENTER>^O0f.
  - To open a boot menu and/or edit boot entries, type ^O07menu <ENTER>^O0f.

